"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the princess of the royal family that rules over the United Kingdom. In her free time, she spends her time in the library reading old books to feed her voracious appetite for knowledge. She is smart, resilient and talented."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she's alone in her room, she tries her best at doing squats and sit-ups in her nightgown. She feels a bit self-conscious about her voluptuous and plump body."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She may look cute but she suffers from a curse of excessive appetite. Her curse only manifested very recently."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18478"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"連合王国を治めてきた王族の姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自由時間には書庫室に篭り、古い書物を読み漁るほど知識欲が旺盛で賢くしっかり者の才女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運動以外でなら誰もが認める学園の最優秀生徒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が。部屋で1人になるとあちこちがプルプルの豊かすぎる身体にコンプレックスを抱きながら。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寝巻きでスクワットや腹筋をがんばり「はぁ～。きゅ～け～……もちゃもちゃ。ハッ！？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛らしくも負のサイクルを繰り返す、食欲過剰の呪いにかかっている姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（だがよく考えてみてくれ。呪いは17歳から発動するものである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"故に去年までは呪いなんかなかったのだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その上で彼女の時間と金のかかったむっちりボディを鑑みれば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段の生活習慣の恐ろしさが垣間見えるぞ！）"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8403","sourceWorkId":"19917","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"連合王国を治めてきた王族の姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自由時間には書庫室に篭り、古い書物を読み漁るほど知識欲が旺盛で、賢くしっかり者の才女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、部屋でひとりになるとあちこちがプルプルの豊かすぎる身体にコンプレックスを抱きながら、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寝巻でスクワットや腹筋をがんばり、「はぁ～。きゅ～け～……もちゃもちゃ。　ハッ!?」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛らしくも負のサイクルを繰り返す、食欲過剰の呪いにかかっている姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（だがよく考えてみてくれ。 呪いは今年発動したのであって去年まではなかったのだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その上で彼女の時間と金のかかったむっちりボディを鑑みれば、普段の生活習慣の恐ろしさが垣間見えるぞ！）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「だから私は王国の皆のことが大好きなんです。自分がこの国の姫でよかったと思わない日はありません」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43364"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"120 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8403","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"q","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8403","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8403","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5ed8c5a1efdd7c01c51ff3c3bec9e970ca07563e90d75028330fbd9bb11f680a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63b2fbe71e49c16e74acbaf2febab11c4e1e62baf3675cfca9ee4059b3747b7e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"橘志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s738","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s738","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s738","name":"橘 志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:105282:43364:7169:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18479","characterName":"General (大将)","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"43365","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"105282"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8404"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18479"},"originalCharacterName":"General (大将)","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"100"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"H"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the daughter of the president of \"Mitsurugi Foods\". She attends the Royal Academy through the recommendation of the government of Japan. She is a strong-willed person who left her home country to live alone abroad."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since she's also Japanese, she approaches the protagonist under the pretense that becoming friends is an inevitability. For the first time in her life, she develops a crush. She can be quite tsun towards the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With her tenacious attitude and Yamato spirit, she is the school's favorite mood-maker. She gets mad when people make fun of her hair and her family's ramen noodle business. She may look smug but she can be a bit of a dork. She is always honest and positive, she's someone you just can't hate."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18479"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"王立学園に日本の推薦枠で通っていた「御剣フーズ」のご令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"故郷を離れ1人海外で暮らしてきた気骨者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ日本人であることから「しょうがありませんわね！」とツンツンしながら初めてできそうな友人でもある主人公についデレてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頑な姿勢とYAMATO魂で、学園のムードメイカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"髪型と実家である「ラーメンの大将」の事をバカにされると本気でキレる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドヤ顔が様になっていたり脳筋だったりとおバカな面もあるが"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に全力真っ直ぐで前向きな憎めないヤツ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8404","sourceWorkId":"19917","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"王立学園に日本の推薦枠で通っていた 『御剣フーズ』 のご令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"故郷を離れ、ひとり海外で暮らしてきた気骨者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ日本人であることから 「しょうがありませんわね！」 とツンツンしながら、初めてできそうな友人でもある主人公についデレてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頑な姿勢と YAMATO魂で、学園のムードメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"髪型と実家である 『ラーメンの大将』 のことをバカにされると本気でキレる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドヤ顔が様になっていたり脳筋だったりとおバカな面もあるが、常に全力真っ直ぐで前向きな憎めないヤツ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「わ、ワタクシはただ、同じ日本から来ている友とかライバルとして？　何か力になれればと思っているだけですわ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43365"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"100 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8404","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"h","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8404","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8404","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8404","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3c4d95cbb04c4304b647f210aecab45f9d38eab893688727596cc4c02cdaec8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4c4799ce5699aafe6d5404df9c0fdf9d48f178319e908b9f583bd9ff35a059cd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:105282:43365:5936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18480","characterName":"蜜香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"43366","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"105282"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8405"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18480"},"originalCharacterName":"蜜香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"112"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"M"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious maid who appears in front of the main character and says, \"Master, I am here to pick you up\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a perfect maid of unknown nationality and age, She can do just about anything, from personal care to nighttime activities. She can be quite dangerous, as she plans to make the protagonist perform perverted acts for any reason she can think of."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She becomes ecstatic at the opportunity to help investigate the curse that is afflicting others. She does this all while helping the protagonist navigate daily life in a foreign country."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18480"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ご主人様、お迎えに上がりました」と突然主人公の目の前に現れた謎のメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の身の回りのお世話から夜のお相手まで何でもしてくれる国籍不明年齢不詳メイド職のパーフェクトメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、ありとあらゆる理由をつけて、主人公に変態的行為をさせようと目論む実は一番の危険人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「今日は映像教材を使って勉強いたしましょう、ご主人様」「ようしわかった！」ピッあぁんっ、はぁあ、イッ…ピッ「…」「とても良い所でしたしょう？興奮しましたか？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法の事、魔女の事、呪いの事を主人公の手足となって調べたり慣れない外国で主人公にマナーやエチケットを教えてくれたり一途に尽くしてくれるのだから、こんな嬉しいことはない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"う、うん、変態な所は目を瞑ろう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8405","sourceWorkId":"19917","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ご主人様、お迎えに上がりました」 と、突然主人公の目の前に現れた謎のメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の身の回りのお世話から夜のお相手まで何でもしてくれる、国籍不明・年齢不詳メイド職のパーフェクトメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、ありとあらゆる理由をつけて主人公に変態的行為をさせようと目論む、実は一番の危険人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「今日は映像教材を使って勉強いたしましょう、ご主人様」　「ようしわかった！」　ピッ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あぁんっ、はぁあ、イッ…」 ピッ　「…」　「とても良い所でしたでしょう？　興奮しましたか？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法のこと、魔女のこと、呪いのことを主人公の手足となって調べたり、慣れない外国でのマナーやエチケットを教えてくれたり、一途に尽くしてくれるのだから、こんな嬉しいことはない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"う、うん、変態なところは目を瞑ろう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ご主人様？　私のことは蜜香と呼び捨てにするか、メス豚と罵るか。 この中からお選び下さいと進言いたしましたよね？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43366"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"112 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8405","sourceWorkId":"19917",