e than three meals a day. She's capable of knowing Himeko's body weight and her mood with just a single glance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn't show her emotions much and has a calm and cool demeanor, but when it comes to Himeko, she can get very excitable. Her daily routine involves praising Himeko with compliments she loves to hear. Compliments such as \"the general is amazing\" or \"just as you'd expect from the general\". Anzu is very skilled at this."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of the relationship Himeko has with the protagonist, she acts a bit cold towards him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She knows a lot about video games and anime, and secretly looks forward to seeing the competitive Himeko make a face of defeat when she loses in a game."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"With the approval of Himeko, Anzu becomes the protagonist's mistress"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18481"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"姫子に仕えるメイド。三度の飯より姫子が好きで、慕っているというよりも愛しちゃっていて、姫子のことなら体重、体調から気分まで見ただけで分かるほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「大将、好き（ガチ）」「ワタクシもよ（家族感覚）」二人の前途は多難である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情をあまり表にださず、淡々とクールな態度だが、姫子の事になると熱くなる事も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「よっ、大将」「流石。大将」「大将はすごい」と誉められるのが大好きな姫子を煽るのが日課。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"のせ上手。姫子と仲のいい主人公には若干冷たいようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8406","sourceWorkId":"19917","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8406","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"b","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8406","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8406","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8406","sourceWorkId":"19917","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"met